        "attribute": "Minimizes Residuals",
        "explanation": "It mathematically minimizes the sum of squared vertical distances between data points and the line, ensuring the most accurate linear fit."
      },
      {
        "attribute": "Linear Relationship Indicator",
        "explanation": "It quantifies the direction and strength of a linear association, with slope indicating rate of change and intercept representing the baseline value."
      }
    ],
    "applications_use_cases": [
      {
        "application": "Predictive Analytics in Economics",
        "example": "Economists use the line of best fit to forecast consumer spending based on income levels, enabling informed fiscal policy and budget planning using historical data."
